<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 15:29:37 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>从德国机场到波兰无人机工厂火灾，欧盟面临一波疑似俄罗斯破坏活动</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/germany-russia-drone-attack-eu-response/</link><description>欧盟已经对俄罗斯实施了近两打制裁方案，但领导人对可能升级为直接冲突的措施持谨慎态度。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293028098-e1788355420580.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:19:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/germany-russia-drone-attack-eu-response/</guid></item><item><title>尽管是千万富翁，苏西·奥曼仍然尽可能在家做饭，并表示外出就餐是最大的金钱浪费之一</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/personal-finance-expert-suze-orman-eating-out-waste-of-money-cooks-at-home-as-multimillionaire/</link><description>苏西·奥曼（Suze Orman）的银行存款有数百万美元，但她仍然保持节俭，拒绝外出就餐或去星巴克。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1146917073-e1788359809953.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 15:03:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/personal-finance-expert-suze-orman-eating-out-waste-of-money-cooks-at-home-as-multimillionaire/</guid></item><item><title>苹果公司首席执行官约翰·特努斯 (John Ternus) 于周二上任。他的 5500 万美元奖金将于明年开始发放</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/apple-ceo-john-ternus-started-tuesday-his-55-million-award-starts-next-year/</link><description>苹果将​​新任首席执行官年度股权目标的 75% 与相对于标准普尔 500 指数的股东回报挂钩。这两个奖项要到 2027 财年才会授予。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2287315876-e1788311154787.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 01:45:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/apple-ceo-john-ternus-started-tuesday-his-55-million-award-starts-next-year/</guid></item><item><title>随着苹果公司 (Apple) 任命约翰·特努斯 (John Ternus) 为新任首席执行官，蒂姆·库克 (Tim Cook) 分享了他在担任最高职位 15 年来一直坚持的凌晨 4 点的例行公事</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/apple-gets-new-ceo-john-ternus-tim-cook-shares-4am-morning-ritual-stuck-by-15-years/</link><description>蒂姆·库克 (Tim Cook) 15 年来一直在凌晨 4 点之前起床，阅读数百封苹果客户的电子邮件，他说这促使他“更加努力地工作，走得更远”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2279915470-e1788359978327.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:42:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/02/apple-gets-new-ceo-john-ternus-tim-cook-shares-4am-morning-ritual-stuck-by-15-years/</guid></item><item><title>“愿上帝保佑我们”：大峡谷山洪暴发造成 1 人死亡、15 人失踪——更多洪水预报</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/one-dead-15-missing-grand-canyon-flood/</link><description>洪水冲毁了人行天桥，对为大峡谷村约 1,600 名居民提供服务的管道现代化改造工作造成了重大打击。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26242754940194-e1788184135912.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 13:57:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/one-dead-15-missing-grand-canyon-flood/</guid></item><item><title>热带国家帕劳没有红绿灯，只有 18,000 人，现在是中美对峙的归零地</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/pacific-forum-us-china-taiwan-palau/</link><description>小岛屿国家控制着战略水域、港口和潜在的海底矿产，使它们在争夺太平洋影响力的竞争中具有影响力&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26243207221320-e1788184384708.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:08:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/pacific-forum-us-china-taiwan-palau/</guid></item><item><title>尼泊尔洪水导致近千人失踪，洪水导致 10% 的发电能力瘫痪，数百人被困在水电隧道中</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/nepal-floods-hydropower-climate-infrastructure/</link><description>这场灾难破坏了尼泊尔各地的水电项目，迫使官员们面对脆弱的喜马拉雅山谷重建工作日益增长的风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26243402664356.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:10:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/nepal-floods-hydropower-climate-infrastructure/</guid></item><item><title>索尼和华纳音乐起诉 Anthropic 涉嫌盗窃“数万首”歌曲，其中包括《我是海象》和《哈利路亚》</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/anthropic-warner-sony-music-songs-lawsuit/</link><description>音乐出版商要求每首盗版歌曲赔偿最高 15 万美元，并为每首删除的版权信息赔偿 25,000 美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289852391-e1788209792703.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/anthropic-warner-sony-music-songs-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>年轻的 Kalshi 用户今年在体育和连本带利类型合约上的交易额估计为 $3.9B，暴露了一个允许他们在 21 岁之前下注的漏洞</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/kalshi-users-under-21-traded-3-9-billion-sports-prediction-markets-age-loophole-gambling-regulation/</link><description>批评者警告说，预测市场允许 18 岁的青少年进行体育投注，同时绕过国家投注年龄限制。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2270935165-e1788210240454.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:26:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/kalshi-users-under-21-traded-3-9-billion-sports-prediction-markets-age-loophole-gambling-regulation/</guid></item><item><title>PBR 承诺，窃贼在下周二之前“不问任何问题”归还 40,000 磅被盗啤酒。这不会阻止加州检察官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/pabst-blue-ribbon-california-40000-pounds-pbr-beer-stolen/</link><description>据警方称，这大约是 34,000 罐啤酒，价值约 70,000 美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2196641407-e1788205338598.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:04:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/pabst-blue-ribbon-california-40000-pounds-pbr-beer-stolen/</guid></item></channel></rss>